            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to pass away, then the Marathi for to arise."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: वृत्तपत्र",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वृत्तपत्र — vṛttapatra — \"a newspaper\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आजोबा रोज सकाळी वृत्तपत्र वाचतात. ājobā roj sakāḷī vṛttapatra vāctāt. Grandpa reads the newspaper every morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also वर्तमानपत्र, and in speech पेपर."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वृत्तपत्र (vṛttapatra) is a modern compound built from Sanskrit vṛtta, 'what has happened, an event', and patra, 'a leaf, a letter' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
