            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्या छापखान्याने हजार पुस्तकं छापली. tyā chāpkhānyāne hajār pustakaṁ chāplī. That press printed a thousand books."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने छापलं, tyāne chāplaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is printed agrees: पुस्तक छापलं, बातमी छापली."
            }
          ]
        },
